# Waitlist — src/components/WaitlistCta.tsx
#
# Applications are collected on a Google Form. The site links out to it, so
# there is nothing to deploy and no secret to keep: make the form, copy the
# share URL, set it here.
#
#   1. forms.new (signed in as the sudo-cut.com Workspace account)
#   2. Two required questions: email address, and channel link.
#      Turn ON  Settings → Responses → "Collect email addresses" if you would
#      rather Google capture it than ask.
#   3. Responses tab → link it to a Sheet, so applications are reviewable and
#      you can mark who you invited.
#   4. Send → the link icon → copy the URL. Paste it below, and into the Vercel
#      project (Settings → Environment Variables) for Production and Preview.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ because it is read at render time and baked into the page. That
# is correct here — the form URL is public by definition, it is a link visitors
# click. Never put anything secret behind a NEXT_PUBLIC_ name.
#
# Changing it requires a redeploy, since it is inlined at build time.
#
# IF UNSET the button falls back to mailto:support@sudo-cut.com rather than
# rendering a dead link, so the page is never broken — but nobody reaches a
# form, so set it before pointing a domain at this.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WAITLIST_FORM_URL=https://forms.gle/xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
